    {
      "id": "el324562906",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 503.5,
      "height": 131.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 789189460,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1286767661,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT LIMITS FIRST?  THE SCHEDULER, NOT KV\nKV allows 14-64 sequences per worker.\n--max-running-requests = 8 stops each worker at 8.\n\nMeasured: engines ran exactly their cap,\nKV usage ~0-1 % (H100), peak 8.8 % (A100),\n0 retractions.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT LIMITS FIRST?  THE SCHEDULER, NOT KV\nKV allows 14-64 sequences per worker.\n--max-running-requests = 8 stops each worker at 8.\n\nMeasured: engines ran exactly their cap,\nKV usage ~0-1 % (H100), peak 8.8 % (A100),\n0 retractions.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
